# Dory - Project Context

## What This Is

Private enterprise iOS/SwiftUI coding agent designed for large codebase handling.
Single-user, private use only.

## Primary Objective

Eliminate traditional AI constraints on exceptionally large iOS SwiftUI projects:
- No time limits on sessions
- No context size restrictions (1M tokens via Nemotron 3 Nano)
- No file count limitations (RAG indexes entire Xcode projects)

## Target Use Case

- 100k+ line iOS projects
- 500+ Swift files
- XIBs, storyboards, assets, plists
- Full Xcode project comprehension

## Architecture

```
iOS Project (100k+ lines)
         │
         ▼
RAG Pipeline (nvidia/llama-3.2-nv-embedqa-1b-v2)
  • Index .swift, .xib, .storyboard, .plist
  • Chunk by class/struct/extension boundaries
         │
         ▼
Nemotron 3 Nano (1M context)
  • Load 50-100 relevant files at once
  • Reason across entire feature/module
```

## NVIDIA Stack

| Component | Model ID |
|-----------|----------|
| Main LLM | nvidia/nemotron-3-nano-30b-a3b |
| Embeddings | nvidia/llama-3.2-nv-embedqa-1b-v2 |
| Reranker | nvidia/llama-3.2-nv-rerankqa-1b-v2 |

## Not Using (by design)

- Nemotron Safety models (private use, no guardrails needed)
- Nemotron Personas datasets (not a consumer chatbot)
- RL/fine-tuning datasets (using base models)

## Key Insight

1M context + RAG = load 20-50 most relevant files into single context,
reason holistically across entire feature instead of file-by-file.
